      "writtenOn": "2022-02-28T15:28:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because the return value basically means \"should we continue parsing?\". A broken expression means no, something like -1 means report an error but we\u0027re fine to keep going.\n\nI originally coded this as a tristate (valid / invalid / parse error), but the valid and invalid cases always ended up doing the same thing, so it didn\u0027t seem worth keeping the distinction.",
      "parentUuid": "d0f08f91_11eab23b",
